# G111 — ERD Creator

*v2. See `erd-creator.md` for prose: topological sort + cycle detection,
DOT output for visualization, entity + relationship as complementary records.*

---

## Choreographic Case: Vault Schema Diagram

[schema-diagram @db-connection
    IN ORDER TO
        introspect a live database, build an ERD, validate it
        render DOT and invoke graphviz to produce SVG
        and surface any cycles as warnings

    @erd <- [erd[new]]
    @tables <- [db[introspect-schema {connection: @db-connection}]]
    for @t in @tables
        [erd[add-entity {erd: @erd, entity: @t}]]

    @fks <- [db[introspect-foreign-keys {connection: @db-connection}]]
    for @fk in @fks
        [erd[add-relationship {erd: @erd, relationship: @fk}]]

    @issues <- [erd[validate {erd: @erd}]]
    @issues
        where count is zero
        @dot <- [erd[to-dot {erd: @erd}]]
        [vault[save {path: "schema/erd.dot", content: @dot}]]
        [shell[run {command: "dot -Tsvg schema/erd.dot -o schema/erd.svg"}]]
        || [ui[show-validation-issues {issues: @issues}]]

    @cycles <- [erd[find-cycles {erd: @erd}]]
    @cycles
        where count at least 1
        #warning "foreign-key cycles detected: " + @cycles
]

---

## Verb Surface

[erd
    new
    add-entity           {erd, entity}
    add-relationship     {erd, relationship}
    dependencies-of      {erd, name}
    topo-sort            {erd}                  ;; || cycle-exists
    find-cycles          {erd}
    validate             {erd}
    to-dot               {erd}
    to-translator-tables {erd}
]

---

## Distinctive Innate idiom: topo-sort resistance means cycle

[erd[topo-sort {erd: @erd}]
    || @cycles <- [erd[find-cycles {erd: @erd}]]
       -> #cycle-found @cycles

Kahn's algorithm yields a valid ordering or proves impossibility.
Resistance here carries structural meaning: "there is a cycle, run
find-cycles to see which tables."

---

## Demo

[demo
    @erd <- [erd[new]]
    [erd[add-entity {erd: @erd, entity: {name: "user", columns: [...]}}]]
    [erd[add-entity {erd: @erd, entity: {name: "post", columns: [...]}}]]
    [erd[add-entity {erd: @erd, entity: {name: "comment", columns: [...]}}]]
    [erd[add-relationship {erd: @erd,
                             relationship: {from: "post", to: "user",
                                             kind: "many-to-one"}}]]
    [erd[add-relationship {erd: @erd,
                             relationship: {from: "comment", to: "post",
                                             kind: "many-to-one"}}]]
    [erd[add-relationship {erd: @erd,
                             relationship: {from: "comment", to: "user",
                                             kind: "many-to-one"}}]]

    -> [erd[topo-sort {erd: @erd}]]       ;; -> ["user", "post", "comment"]
    -> [erd[find-cycles {erd: @erd}]]     ;; -> []
]
